    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Clearcasting.</strong> When you score a Critical Hit with a spell's attack roll, you can take a Reaction to cast a cantrip that has a casting time of an action.</p><p><strong>Force Adept.</strong> When you roll damage for a spell you cast that deals Force damage, you can treat any 1 on a damage die as a 2.</p>",
